Gemmified-Butterscotch
======================

A fork of Butterscotch <https://github.com/ButterscotchRunner/Butterscotch>
that packages its web build as a plugin for hosts that speak the GEMS plugin
protocol.

It is based on upstream commit 0c94bfb05e3cb4b8946a38f8085747035dd37f94
(2026-11-11). Upstream commits after that one are not included.

