Source
------

The plugin a host downloads (butterscotch-<version>.zip) is a build of this
repository. Its Corresponding Source is this repository at the tag
v<version>, <https://github.com/QuentinJanuel/Gemmified-Butterscotch>, and a
tarball of it is published beside every build:
https://gemmified-butterscotch.dappermink.me/<version>/gemmified-butterscotch-<version>-src.tar.gz
This file and LICENSE ship inside the zip.

Third-party components
----------------------

The runner (butterscotch.wasm, butterscotch.mjs) links the libraries in
vendor/ (box2d, bzip2, glad, md5, miniaudio, miniz, mojoal, sha1, stb, wuffs,
base64, tinyfd) under their own licences, each in its directory, and the
Emscripten runtime (MIT, <https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten>).
